{"track":"sql","category":"기초 조회","level":1,"title":"ICN 출발 항공편","datasets":["flights"],"desc":"<p>출발지(<code>origin</code>)가 <code>'ICN'</code>인 항공편의 번호와 목적지를 <code>flight_id</code> 순서로 조회하세요.</p><p>열: <code>flight_id</code>, <code>destination</code></p>","starter":"-- 여기에 쿼리를 작성하세요\n","ordered":true,"solution":"SELECT flight_id, destination\nFROM flights\nWHERE origin = 'ICN'\nORDER BY flight_id;","hint":"<p>조건 → 정렬 순서로 써요: <code>WHERE</code> 다음에 <code>ORDER BY</code>.</p>","id":"sql-036","expected":{"columns":["flight_id","destination"],"rows":[[2,"BKK"],[3,"NRT"],[5,"KIX"],[8,"NRT"],[9,"HKG"],[12,"HKG"],[14,"HKG"],[20,"KIX"],[23,"BKK"]]}}